]DE_ATTR_COMMENT]
[EN_ATTR_COMMENT[
The target environment (also known as the sphere of influence) is the group of people who want, should or must communicate and work with each other using an well defined language described in the information model.
]EN_ATTR_COMMENT]

[DE_ATTR_COMMENT[
